# env.optional — content-strategy
#
# ALL OPTIONAL — gate-traced. Each integration CLI hard-gates on its own token
# (e.g. tools/clis/<tool>.js: `if (!TOKEN) { console.error('...required'); process.exit(1) }`),
# but this skill is knowledge that can use ANY of several alternative tools — or
# none at all. No single tool is a prerequisite (real fallback: a different tool,
# or pure-knowledge output), so every var below is OPTIONAL. The user supplies
# keys only for the tools they actually have.
# Tools this skill can use: ahrefs, airops, beehiiv, dataforseo, demio, exa, firehose, keywords-everywhere, kit, livestorm, plausible, rankparse, semrush, similarweb, sparktoro, supermetrics, webflow, wordpress
AHREFS_API_KEY
AIROPS_API_KEY
AIROPS_WORKSPACE_ID
BEEHIIV_API_KEY
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
DEMIO_API_KEY
DEMIO_API_SECRET
EXA_API_KEY
FIREHOSE_API_KEY
KEYWORDS_EVERYWHERE_API_KEY
KIT_API_KEY
KIT_API_SECRET
LIVESTORM_API_TOKEN
